hadiths[31]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1506","[AI-translation] Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen ghode ka gosht khilaya aur gadhe ke gosht se mana farmaya."
"1507","[AI-translation] Asma se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ghoda zibah kiya phir use khaya."
"1508","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Ammar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Abdullah se dab'u ke bare mein poocha ke kya woh shikar hai? Unhon ne kaha: Han. To main ne poocha: Kya woh khaai jati hai? Unhon ne kaha: Han. To main ne poocha: Kya tum ne yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Han."
"1509","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Ammar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Abdullah se dab'u ke bare mein poocha ke kya woh shikar hai? To unhon ne kaha: Han. Main ne kaha: Kya woh khaai jati hai? Unhon ne kaha: Han. Main ne kaha: Kya tum ne yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Han."
"1510","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se dab ke bare mein poocha gaya to Aap ne farmaya: 'Main use na khata hun aur na haram karta hun.'"
"1511","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Dinar se, Ibn Umar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"1512","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, Shafi'i ne farmaya: Mujhe shak hai ke Malik ne use Ibn Abbas se Khalid bin Waleed se bayan kiya, ya Ibn Abbas aur Khalid bin Waleed se, ke woh donon Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Maimunah ke ghar dakhil hue. Phir bhuna hua dab laya gaya. To Aap ne is ki taraf apna hath badhaya. To Maimunah ke ghar mein maujood baaz aurton ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko batao jo woh khana chahte hain. To unhon ne un se kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Yeh dab hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apna hath utha liya. To main ne poocha: Kya yeh haram hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Nahin, lekin yeh meri qaum ki zameen mein nahin hota, to main apne aap ko is se nafrat karte pata hun.' Khalid ne kaha: Phir main ne use apni taraf khaincha aur khaya jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dekh rahe the."
"1513","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Aslam se, apne walid se, Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hamare liye do murdar aur do khoon halal kiye gae hain. Do murdar: Machhli aur tiddi. Aur do khoon, mera khayal hai unhon ne farmaya: Kaleji aur tilli."
"1514","[AI-translation] Haram bin Sa'd bin Muhaisah se riwayat hai ke Muhaisah ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se paseena lagane ki kamai ke bare mein poocha. To Aap ne use is se mana farmaya. Woh Aap se guftagu karte rahe yahan tak ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Use apne ghulam ko khilao, aur apne oont ko chara do.'"
"1515","[AI-translation] Haram bin Sa'd bin Muhaisah se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se paseena lagane ki ujrat ke bare mein ijazat mangi. To Aap ne use is se mana farmaya. Woh poochte rahe aur ijazat mangte rahe yahan tak ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Use apne oont aur apne ghulam ko khilao.'"
"1516","[AI-translation] Humaid se, Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Taibah ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko paseena lagaya. To Aap ne in ke liye ek sa' khajooron ka hukm diya aur in ke maalikon ko hukm diya ke in se in ka mahsool halka kar den."
"1517","[AI-translation] Humaid se, Anas se riwayat hai ke un se kaha gaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne paseena lagwaya. To unhon ne kaha: Han! Abu Taibah ne Aap ko paseena lagaya. To Aap ne use do sa' diye, aur in ke maalikon ko hukm diya ke in se in ka mahsool halka kar den. Aur farmaya: 'Tumhare ilajon mein sab se behtar paseena lagwana aur samandari qust hai tumhare bachchon ke halaq ke dard ke liye, unhen halaq dabane se takleef na do.'"
"1518","[AI-translation] Abdul Wahhab Saqafi se, Ayub se, Ibn Sirin se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai. Sufyan ne khabar di: Mujhe Ibrahim bin Maisarah ne Tawus se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne paseena lagwaya aur paseena lagane wale se farmaya: 'Use is ki ujrat do.'"
"1519","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Muqabla sirf teer, ghode ke sum aur oont ke khur mein hai.'"
"1520","[AI-translation] Abbad bin Abi Salih se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Muqabla sirf ghode ke sum ya oont ke khur mein hai.'"
"1521","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tayyar kiye gae ghodon ke darmiyan daud karai."
"1522","[AI-translation] Abu Idrees Khaulani se, Abu Sa'labah Khushani se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne har daant wale darinde se mana farmaya."
"1523","[AI-translation] Ubaidah bin Sufyan Hazrami se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: 'Har daant wale darinde ka khana haram hai.'"
"1524","[AI-translation] Abu Idrees se, Abu Sa'labah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne har daant wale darinde se mana farmaya."
"1525","[AI-translation] Abu Idrees se, Abu Sa'labah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"1526","[AI-translation] Ubaidah bin Sufyan Hazrami se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Har daant wala darinda haram hai.'"
"1527","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo maweshi ke kutte ya shikari kutte ke siwa kutta pale to is ke amal se har din do qeeraat kam ho jate hain.'"
"1528","[AI-translation] Sa'ib bin Yazeed se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Sufyan bin Abi Zuhair jo Azd Shanu'ah ke ek aadmi the jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba mein se the, ko kahte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jo kutta pale to is ke amal se har din do qeeraat kam ho jate hain.' Logon ne kaha: Kya tum ne yeh khud Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Han! Is masjid ke Rab ki qasam."
"1529","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kutton ko maarne ka hukm diya."
"1530","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Machhli aur tiddi zibah shuda hain."
"1531","[AI-translation] Abayah bin Rifa'ah se, apne walid se, Rafi' bin Khadij se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kal ham dushman se milenge aur hamare paas chhuriyan nahin hain. Kya ham chhaal se zibah karen? To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo khoon bahae aur us par Allah ka naam liya gaya ho to khao. Siwae daant ya nakhun ke. Daant insan ki haddi hai aur nakhun Habsha ki chhuri hai.'"
"1532","[AI-translation] Sa'd Jari ya Abdullah bin Sa'd Maula Umar bin Khattab se riwayat hai ke Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Arab Nasara Ahl Kitab nahin hain. In ka zabiha hamare liye halal nahin hai. Aur main unhen nahin chhodunga yahan tak ke woh Islam laen ya main in ki gardenen marun."
"1533","[AI-translation] Sa'd Falahah Maula Umar ya Ibn Sa'd Falahah se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Arab Nasara Ahl Kitab nahin hain. In ka zabiha hamare liye halal nahin hai. Aur main unhen nahin chhodunga yahan tak ke woh Islam laen ya main in ki gardenen marun."
"1534","[AI-translation] Tsaqafi se, Ayub se, Ibn Sirin se, Ubaidah Salmani se, Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne farmaya: Banu Taghlib ke Nasara ka zabiha na khao, kyunke woh apne deen mein se siwae sharab peene ke kisi cheez par qaim nahin hain."
"1535","[AI-translation] Ayub se, Muhammad bin Sirin se, Ubaidah Salmani se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Arab Nasara Banu Taghlib ka zabiha na khao, kyunke woh apni nasraniyat ya apne deen mein se siwae sharab peene ke kisi cheez par qaim nahin hain, Shafi'i ko shak hua."
"1536","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne farmaya: Ibn Abbas se in ke zabihe ke halal hone ke bare mein jo riwayat hai woh sirf Ikrimah ki hadees se hai. Mujhe Ibn Darawardi aur Ibn Abi Yahya ne Saur Daili se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se khabar di: Beshak un se Arab Nasara ke zabihe ke bare mein poocha gaya. To unhon ne woh baat kahi jo is ke halal hone ki hikayat karti hai aur tilawat ki: Aur jo tum mein se unhen dost banae to woh un mein se hai [Ma'idah: 51]. Lekin hamare sathi ne Ikrimah ke naam se khamoshi ikhtiyar ki, aur Saur ki Ibn Abbas se mulaqat nahin hui."
